msgctxt "75\t189"
msgid "You mentioned a favor.\\nWhat do you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196\t319"
msgid "I need you to save the lives of two men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328\t412"
msgid "Who are they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "415\t535"
msgid "The first is my former secretary, Toma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "550\t634"
msgid "Former? What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "674\t814"
msgid "Two weeks back, he tendered his resignation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "822\t884"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "887\t1060"
msgid ""
"He learned the truth about why\\nI was advocating the military expansion "
"bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1062\t1223"
msgid ""
"And so, he abandoned me for the man\\nnow in control of the resort "
"development."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1236\t1292"
msgid "Which is who?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1318\t1387"
msgid "A yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1390\t1431"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "1435\t1620"
msgid "The head of the Tojo Clan's Hakuho Clan.\\nYoshitaka Mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1622\t1680"
msgid "Mine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1682\t1758"
msgid "Hold the damn phone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1777\t1918"
msgid ""
"There's a high probability Toma will\\nattempt to divulge our secrets to "
"Mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1920\t2067"
msgid "Guaranteeing that someone will\\nin turn try to silence him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2073\t2133"
msgid "\"Someone\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2149\t2245"
msgid "Is this the other man you want me to save?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2247\t2294"
msgid "That's correct."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2296\t2425"
msgid "I need you to make sure he doesn't kill Toma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2441\t2501"
msgid "And who is he, exactly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2542\t2608"
msgid "Joji Kazama."
msgstr ""
